OPEN DOCKER DESKTOP

:: 1. Check Docker
docker --version
docker version

:: 2. Check kubectl
kubectl version --client

:: 3. Check Minikube
minikube version

:: 4. Start Kubernetes cluster
minikube start --driver=docker

:: 5. Check cluster status
minikube status
kubectl get nodes

:: 6. Create the Pod YAML file
notepad nginx-pod.yaml


apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: nginx-pod
spec:
  containers:
    - name: nginx
      image: nginx
      ports:
        - containerPort: 80








cmd))



:: 7. Create the Pod
kubectl apply -f nginx-pod.yaml

:: 8. Check the Pod
kubectl get pods

:: 9. Get detailed Pod information
kubectl describe pod nginx-pod

:: 10. Forward the Pod port
kubectl port-forward pod/nginx-pod 8081:80




http://localhost:8081


You should see the NGINX welcome page.

After testing, return to CMD and press Ctrl + C to stop port forwarding. Then run:

:: 11. Delete the Pod
kubectl delete pod nginx-pod

:: 12. Verify Pod deletion
kubectl get pods

        
